  "details": "https://www.hackerone.com/\nPlease consider joining HackerOne (or a similar site) to incentivize the disclosure of security vulnerabilities.\nCurrently, it's difficult to talk about security flaws publicly, and there's no guaranteed follow-up or reward. By creating a HackerOne page, issues are less likely to go unreported, and VRChat may become more secure.\nI understand that VRChat may not have the resources to manage a HackerOne page right now, but I think it would be a nice thing to strive for.",
